# Copy this file to `.env.local` (which is gitignored) if you want it on hand
# for the re-wire follow-up.
#
# As of the design refresh (see README "Current state"), this variable is NOT
# read by anything the UI actually calls: `lib/api/`, `lib/auth/`, and
# `lib/chat-reconcile`/`lib/chat-trace` remain in the tree but are not
# imported by any page. `app/_layout.tsx` instead calls the vendored
# `@workspace/api-client-react` client's `setBaseUrl()` with
# `EXPO_PUBLIC_DOMAIN`, which isn't set outside a Replit workspace either —
# so today's build makes real (and expectedly failing) network calls to no
# configured host. This file is kept so the value is ready when the re-wire
# issue reconnects `lib/api/` to the new pages.
#
# EXPO_PUBLIC_* vars are inlined at bundle time: restart `expo start` after editing.

EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=https://api-staging.askansari.ai
